# SMK Document Server v2 — REST & M2M Smoke Scenarios
# Use with VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client against docker-compose.v2.yml (:8080)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = smk_live_DevMaster01_DevMasterSecretToken1234567890
@projectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@bearerToken = replace-with-jwt-from-login
@ifMatch = "v1"

### 1. Health & Service Info (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Portal Login (Obtain JWT Bearer & Discover Project-Id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@sammakorn.co.th",
  "password": "Admin@2026!"
}

### 3. List Accessible Workspaces (Self-Service JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/portal/projects?limit=20&includeTotal=true
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 4. M2M Data Connections (Authorization: ApiKey + Project-Id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/data-connections?limit=20&includeTotal=false
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Project-Id: {{projectId}}

### 5. List Templates (Offset Pagination + limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates?limit=20&includeTotal=true
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Project-Id: {{projectId}}

### 6. Pipeline A — Synchronous Document Generation (201 JSON Metadata + Gateway Stream URL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Project-Id: {{projectId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "invoice-sample",
  "outputFormat": "pdf",
  "callerApp": "smoke-test",
  "payload": {
    "contractNo": "SMK-2026-001",
    "amount": 2500000
  }
}

### 7. Stream Generated Artifact via Zero-Trust Gateway (Log ID from data.url)
@generationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/generation-logs/{{generationId}}/artifact/file
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Project-Id: {{projectId}}

### 8. Pipeline C — Create Async Batch Job (202 Accepted + Location + Retry-After)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/document-jobs
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Project-Id: {{projectId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callerApp": "smoke-test",
  "items": [
    {
      "templateSlug": "invoice-sample",
      "outputFormat": "pdf",
      "documentRef": "INV-001",
      "payload": { "contractNo": "SMK-2026-001" }
    }
  ]
}

### 9. List Document Jobs (Cursor Pagination + PagedApiResponse Envelope)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/document-jobs?limit=20
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Project-Id: {{projectId}}

### 10. Cancel Document Job with Optimistic Concurrency (If-Match)
@jobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/document-jobs/{{jobId}}:cancel
Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}
Project-Id: {{projectId}}
If-Match: {{ifMatch}}
